      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "It is a heavy and understandable weight to carry when the world feels so indifferent, and feeling a desire to let go can seem like a form of self-preservation. However, letting go of the need to matter doesn't mean you should let go of yourself either. You deserve to exist not because the world requires it, but because your own existence is valid regardless of anyone's notice.",
